## `#K3d`

[[template "table" .Definitions.K3d]]

`#K3sComponent` is one of `"traefik"`, `"servicelb"`, `"metrics-server"`, or `"local-storage"`. `#MemoryLimit` is a number with an optional unit of `b`, `k`, `m`, or `g`, in either case, such as `"512m"` or `"2g"`.

